# Ignore everything by default
*

# Allow source code and config files needed for build
!apps/
!packages/
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.build.json
!.npmrc

# Exclude build artifacts and dev files within allowed dirs
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.env*
**/.DS_Store
**/README.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/LICENSE
**/*.md

# ...except the Agent Skills, which are product source, not documentation:
# apps/frontend generates its published /SKILL.md routes from them at build time.
# (Last matching rule wins, so this negation must stay below `**/*.md`.)
!packages/agent/skills/**
